{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05130","headline":"度安海入龙编 · 沈佺期","name":"度安海入龙编","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我来交趾郡，南与贯胸连。\n四气分寒少，三光置日偏。\n尉佗曾驭国，翁仲久游泉。\n邑屋遗甿在，鱼盐旧产传。\n越人遥捧翟，汉将下看鸢。\n北斗崇山挂，南风涨海牵。\n别离频破月，容鬓骤催年。\n昆弟推由命，妻孥割付缘。\n梦来魂尚扰，愁委疾空缠。\n虚道崩城泪，明心不应天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}